  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EST 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalī īhelilwe gīkī ī shilagīlo sha ntemi shishikīlījiwe mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'idatū ng'weji gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī, ū ng'weji gwa Adali. Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo a banishi ba Bayudaya baalī bisagīlwa gīkī bakūbakenaagūla; alīyo ī mihayo yūgalūka; a Bayudaya būbiza na nguzu ja kūbaheeba a banishi babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu sī jose ījo jalī mu būsugi bo ntemi Ahasuelo, a Bayudaya bibilinga ū mu mizengo yabo, kwilwisha nabo abo baalī na ng'hūmbū ja kūbīītīla yabūbi. Atigelile nūūlū ūmò wa kūbīmīla, nguno a banhū ba mahanga a gangī baalī babogoha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo pye a bana ng'oma ba mu sī jose, na a baanangwa, na a basugi, pye na a bagunanhi ba ntemi babagunanhaga a Bayudaya, nguno ī lyogohya lya ng'wa Modekai lyalī lyabagwīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Modekai akabiza ntaale no ū ng'wikūlū, ū lūkumo lwakwe lūsambaala hose hose ū mu sī jenījo, nīyo ūyūja alongeja dūhū ū kūbiza na būdūla būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bayudaya būyūbakūūbīlīja a banishi babo būbabūlaga na kūbakenaagūla, nīyo būyūbīītīla a banishi babo gīt'ūmo baalī batogelilwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abo bakabūlagwa mu Susa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nzengo gwa Susa, a Bayudaya bakababūlaga bagosha magana atanò, būbakenaagūla gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbabūlaga ba Pashandasa, Dalifoni, Asipasa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Polasa, Adalia, Alidasa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamashita, Alisai, Alidai, na Vaizasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bitūnja ikūmi a ba ng'wa Hamani, ng'wana Hamedasa, ū ng'wanishi o Bayudaya; alīyo ī shikolo batasolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi winhwa ū lūshikū lwenūlo dūhū ūwingī wa banhū abo bakabūlagwa ū mu nzengo gwa Susa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū ngole Esita, “Ū mu nzengo gwa Susa a Bayudaya babūlagaga bagosha magana atanò, hamò na a bitūnja ikūmi a ba ng'wa Hamani. Al'ū mu sī ī jingī ī ja ntemi bīītaga kinehe lūūlū? Ī gīsī ī ng'hūmbū jako jitaalī ha mhayo kī? Ūkwinhwa dūhū. Ūtaalī ūlīlomba mhayo kī? Ūkūshikīlīgījiwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esita ūhaya, “Ūlū gūlīnyeja ū ntemi, a Bayudaya ba mu Susa bazunīlījiwe nī ntondo bīīte gīt'ūmo shilī ī shilagīlo sha lelo, nīyo a bitūnja abo ikūmi a ba ng'wa Hamani banungelejiwe ha mantī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū ntemi ūlagīla gīkī yītwe ī yenīyo, shufunyiwa shilagīlo ū mu Susa; nī mibīlī ya bitūnja ikūmi a ba ng'wa Hamani yūnungelejiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bayudaya ba mu Susa bibilinga hangī ū mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'inè ū mu ng'weji gwa Ada, būbūlaga ū mu Susa bagosha magana adatū, alīyo ī shikolo batasolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a Bayudaya a bangī ū mu sī pyī ījo jalī ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bokwe ū ntemi bibilinga kūbūlwīlīīla būpanga wabo, bifuule a makoye ga kūfuma kū banishi babo. Bakabūlaga banhū shihūmbī makūmi mpungatī na shitanò, abo baalī banishi babo, alīyo ī shikolo batasolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yenīyī īkīītwa mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'idatū mu ng'weji gwa Adali, ū mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'inè bifuula būlwīta kūbiza lwa kūyega na kwīta shigukulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigukulu sha Pulimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Bayudaya ba mu Susa, a bene bakibilinga ū mu lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'idatū nū lw'ikūmi n'inè, bifuula lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'itanò; ū lwenūlo hū būlwīta kūbiza lwa kūyega na kūbeeja shigukulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene a Bayudaya ba kū magūngūli, ū kū mizengo īyo ītapīndīlījiwe ndugu, badimīīlile lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'inè ū mu ng'weji gwa Adali, h'ūlo balwisaabile gīkī lwa kūyega na kūbeeja shigukulu; lūshikū lwa kwitūmīla manong'ho ga kwihoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Modekai wīyandīka pyī ī yenīyī, ūbatwalīla nyalūba pye a Bayudaya abo bikalaga hose hose ū mu sī ījo jalī jisugilwe na ntemi Ahasuelo; a ba kūle na a ba bbihī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbakomeleja kwizukwa būlī ng'waka kūbiza na shigukulu sha būyegi ū mu shikū jenījo, ū lw'ikūmi n'inè nū lw'ikūmi n'itanò, ng'weji gwa Adali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jenījo bajiisaabe gīkī jikabinha a Bayudaya kwifuula kūfuma mu kūluhiwa na banishi babo, nū ng'weji gwenūyo bagūbone gīkī ū mugo, ū būpīna wabo būkagalūka kūbiza būyegi, nī ng'hūngū yabo yūgalūka kūbiza lūshikū lwa būyegi. Ūbakomeleja gīkī ī shikū jenījo bajīīte kūbiza shikū ja kūyega na kūlya shigukulu. Shikū ja kwiyinha shilīwa shawiza, na kūbizūkwa a bahabī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a Bayudaya būzunya ū kūgūdima ū mhayo ūyo baalī bagwandya gwenūyo; būyīta gīt'ūmo akabandīkīla ū Modekai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Hamani ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hamedasa ū muna Agagi, ū ng'wanishi wa Bayudaya walī watūūla mhayo gwa kūbakenaagūla a Bayudaya, ūtūlīja na Puli (h'ī mbale), kūlwa kūbayagaja bashile gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Esita aho washika ū kū būtongi bo ntemi, ū ntemi ūfunya shilagīlo; ū būbi ūbo walī wabūhela ū Hamani kūlwa Bayudaya, būng'widīkīla kū ntwe gwakwe wei ng'wenekīlī; ū wei na a bitūnja bakwe būnungelejiwa ha mantī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene ī shikū jenījo jikitanwa Pulimu, kūlondeela ī lina ī lya Puli. Hūna lūūlū kūlwa nguno ya yose īyo yalī yandīkwa ū mu nyalūba yenīyo, nī yose īyo bakībona, nī yīyo bakībītīla ū mu mhayo gwenūyū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a Bayudaya bakabona gīkī, a boi na a banhū ba shibyalīlwe shabo īsho shiliza, na a bangī pye abo bakwilūnga nabo, babize na shīmīle sha kūyūjiyegela ī shikū būbīlī wajo jenīji būlī ng'waka; yaya ū kūleka ū kwīshikīlīja īyo yandīkīlilwe nī likanza īlo līhelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jenīji shiigelile kwizūkīlwa na kūding'wa chiza mu shibyalīlwe shose, na mu būlī kaya, nū mu sī ī jose, nī mizengo pyī ī yose; na gīkī ī shikū ja Pulimu jenīji yaya gete ū kūdalahwa ū mu Bayudaya, nīyo ū mhayo gwa kūjizūkwa ī shikū jenīji gūtizūjimīīla ū mu banhū ba shibyalīlwe shabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
